:"Go Beyond Organic-with RAW Fiber from Garden of Life - 15 RAW, organic superfoods, including sprouted seeds, grains and legumes - ingredients specifically chosen for their exceptional ability to support and maintain optimal bowel function and overall health."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Supports healthy gut flora balance, regular bowel function, and overall health\nHealthy elimination of toxins\nHelps relieve occasional constipation\nSupports healthy cardiovascular function\nHelps maintain healthy blood sugar levels that are already in the normal range\nHelps maintain healthy cholesterol levels that are already in the normal range\nUsing certified organic fiber does not reintroduce toxins to the digestive tract"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Raw"},{"type":"Formulation re: Vegetarian/Vegan","notes":"Vegan"},{"type":"Formulation re: Organic","notes":"Organic"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten free\nDairy free\nPsyllium free\nLactose free\nNo fillers\nNo isolates\nNo synthetic nutrients\nNo artificial sweeteners\nNo preservatives"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Your decision to purchase organic is not only an investment in your health, but in the health of the planet for generations to come."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"2010 Garden of Life LLC"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"RAW"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Excellent source of fiber - 15 RAW organic superfoods"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Supports bowel regularity and elimination of toxins\nPowerful probiotics for added digestive support"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Omega-3 Fatty Acids from Flax and Chia Seeds"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"USDA Organic"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"RAW Food Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Adults mix 1 scoop with any food or beverage one or more times per day. Children four and older may take 1/2 scoop (10 g) daily. Children should be supervised while consuming this product."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Children should be supervised while consuming this product."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"RAW Fiber can be mixed in smoothies, vegetable or fruit juice, cereal or yogurt. RAW Fiber can add nutritional value and fiber to nearly any food or beverage."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Scoop included."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Caution: As with any dietary supplement, consult your healthcare practitioner before using this product, especially if you are pregnant, nursing, anticipate surgery, take medications on a regular basis or are otherwise under medical supervision."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains: Tree nuts (coconut)"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Tree nuts (coconut)\n"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if safety seal is broken or missing."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Contains no filler ingredients, artificial colors or preservatives."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Packaged by weight not volume. Settling may occur."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Certified Renewable Energy\nGreen-e.org"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"We buy 100% certified renewable energy\nRecyclable bottle"},{"type":"General Statements: